ph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/049fc6223dff4b0dce164a044c124c86.avif?t=1764525723\" width=610 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/2c7c65c74a153169c0d90377349551a7.poster.avif?t=1764525723\" width=980 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/2c7c65c74a153169c0d90377349551a7.webm?t=1764525723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/2c7c65c74a153169c0d90377349551a7.mp4?t=1764525723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Discover Brazilian Indigenous themes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of <i>YVY</i> is inspired by indigenous cultures and folklore from Brazil. From music to characters, scenarios, culture, and dialogue, the game provides an opportunity to discover something new and meaningful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Plural Filmes"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/3126ff31b17cabee5255d4ee6b67d0d6a5b94e07/header.jpg?t=1764525723","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommende